    "titleText": {
      "es": "Me pregunto cuánta gente que no esté ocupada de manera obvia diría sí a ir a volar cometas con un extraño. ¡Esto parece trabajo para la Ciencia!",
      "en": "I wonder how many people who are not obviously busy would say yes to going to fly kites with a stranger. This looks like a job for Science!",
      "noteEn": "The title text treats the awkward social experiment as a question that could be tested scientifically."
    },
